  m_text: "Visible light describes the range of which light can be seen by humans,
    often resulting in numerous colours. \r\n\r\nLight itself consists of photons,
    small packets of energy that follow a wave pattern. Photons are often used to
    describe light and can provide insights into how light interacts with different
    materials.\r\n\r\nReferences:\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Light \r\nhttps://www.bbc.co.uk/bitesize/topics/z3nnb9q "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
